@startuml maintenance-ticket-state-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title OPERATION SERVICE - MAINTENANCE TICKET STATE

[*] --> OPEN : create ticket / critical alert
OPEN --> ASSIGNED : assign technician
ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : acknowledge/start work
IN_PROGRESS --> WAITING_FOR_PARTS : update ticket
WAITING_FOR_PARTS --> IN_PROGRESS : parts available
IN_PROGRESS --> READY_FOR_TEST : repair work complete
READY_FOR_TEST --> IN_PROGRESS : post-test failed
READY_FOR_TEST --> COMPLETED : checklist complete\nrepair log exists\nlatest test PASSED
OPEN --> CANCELLED : cancel
ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED : cancel
IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED : cancel
COMPLETED --> OPEN : reopenTicket()

COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note bottom
  Điều kiện đóng ticket là invariant hiện tại.
  Integration phục hồi trạng thái Machine không được giả định ở đây.
end note

@enduml
